<!--
  Note the three payment option rows: all three carry the SAME content-desc
  ("payment_option_row"). Accessibility ID resolution is therefore ambiguous and
  must lose to the unique resource IDs, even though a11y ID outranks resource-id
  on strategy alone. Ambiguity is a harder failure than fragility - a test that
  taps the wrong row fails in a way that looks like a product bug.
-->
<hierarchy rotation="0">
